8,"name":"Darren Eastes","role":"Pedestrian"},{"id":1829229,"name":"Jake Buratti","role":"Civilian"},{"id":1829230,"name":"Rhys Johnson","role":"Barry"},{"id":1829231,"name":"Brooklyn Alian","role":"Popcorn Girl"},{"id":1829232,"name":"Michael Vincent McHugh","role":"University Student"},{"id":1829233,"name":"Susan Kennedy","role":"Orphanage President"},{"id":1829235,"name":"Isabelle Wojciechowska","role":"Popcorn Girl"},{"id":1829236,"name":"Decian Schuman-Buswell","role":"Pizza Guy"},{"id":1829237,"name":"Amanda Hedges","role":"Ballet Dancer"},{"id":1829238,"name":"Rocio Cartes","role":"Carnival Extra"},{"id":1829239,"name":"Daniel Keen","role":"Theatre Usher (uncredited)"},{"id":1709871,"name":"Mikael Koski","role":"Street Punk (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7a7gYpy3PUgmFLoPBYDJKRLyVPa.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Bleeding Steel - Eroe di acciaio","overview":"Lin Dong è un agente delle forze speciali che per proteggere una giovane donna si mette contro una banda criminale. Lin Dong sente verso di lei un legame surreale."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Bleeding Steel","overview":"A hardened special forces agent fights to protect a young woman from a sinister criminal gang. At the same time, he feels a special connection to the young woman, like they have met in a different life.","tagline":"The Fate of Mankind Lies in the Heart of One"},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"机器之血","overview":"2007年，Dr.James在半岛军火商的支持下研究生化人。研究过程中，生化人安德烈发生基因突变大开杀戒，将半岛军火商杀害，并控制其组织，接管生化人的研究。Dr.James侥幸逃生，只好寻求警方的保护。特工林东（成龙 饰）不得以离开生命垂危的小女儿西西，接受证人保护任务... 十三年后，一本科幻小说《机器之血》的出版引出了黑衣生化人组织，神秘骇客李森（罗志祥 饰）（被杀害的半岛军火商的儿子），以及隐姓埋名的林东，三股力量都开始接近一个“普通”女孩Nancy（欧阳娜娜 饰）的生活，想要得到她身上的秘密。而黑衣人幕后受伤隐藏多年的安德烈也再次出手，在多次缠斗之后终于抓走Nancy。林东和李森，不得不以身犯险一同前去解救，关键时刻却发现李森竟然是被杀害的半岛军火商的儿子，生化人的实验记录也落入了李森之手......","tagline":"人类的命运掌握在每个人心中"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aEFLl5sVZ4VEe